COPYRIGHT HOLDER BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER
IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN
CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.

BondVPN routes network traffic and blocks it when its tunnels are down. It is
not a guarantee of anonymity or privacy. Verify your own configuration with
`bondvpn leak-test` before relying on it.

7. IF YOU BREAK THESE TERMS

Your rights under this licence end automatically. They are restored if you put
the breach right within 30 days of being told about it.

8. EARLIER VERSIONS

Releases before this licence permitted commercial use at no charge. Copies
